# No application secrets are required in Vercel.
# D1 is a private Cloudflare Worker binding configured in wrangler.jsonc.
# Vercel proxies /api/wishwheel/* to the configured public Worker hostname.
# Google sign-in uses the public GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID Worker var; see docs/GOOGLE-SIGN-IN.md.
# Never put Cloudflare account API tokens in frontend variables or source control.
